INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('MoonshotAI/kimi-cli/codex-worker', 'codex-worker', 'MoonshotAI', 'kimi-cli', 'community', 'codex-worker MoonshotAI kimi-cli community codex-worker automates parallel tasks for AI agents, utilizing git worktree and tmux sessions. It benefits developers by streamlining tasks like issue triage and code refactoring. Codex-Worker 是一个 CLI 代理，能够并行运行多个 Codex CLI 代理，每个代理在自己的 git worktree 和 tmux 会话中运行。 Codex-Worker は、AIエージェントとして機能する CLI 代理で、複数の Codex CLI 代理を並列に実行します。 Codex-Worker는 병렬로 여러 개의 Codex CLI 에이전트를 실행하는 CLI 에이전트입니다. 각 에이전트는 자신의 git worktree와 tmux 세션에서 실행됩니다. codex-worker es una herramienta para orquestar múltiples agentes de CLI en paralelo, cada uno en su propio git worktree y sesión de tmux codex-worker est un outil pour orchestrer plusieurs agents CLI en parallèle, chacun dans son propre git worktree et session tmux codex-worker ist ein Tool zur Orchestrierung mehrerer CLI-Agents in Parallelsitzungen, jeweils in einem eigenen git worktree und tmux-Sitzung O Codex-Worker é uma ferramenta de orquestração de agentes CLI que permite executar tarefas em paralelo, utilizando git worktree e tmux Codex-Worker - это инструмент оркестровки агентов CLI, позволяющий выполнять задачи параллельно, используя git worktree и tmux Codex-Worker هو أداة لتوجيه وكلاء CLI التي تسمح بتنفيذ المهام في متناول اليد، باستخدام git worktree و tmux how to use codex-worker codex-worker alternative codex-worker setup guide what is codex-worker codex-worker vs other CLI agents codex-worker install codex-worker parallel task automation codex-worker git worktree integration codex-worker tmux session management Codex-Worker CLI 代理 并行任务处理 git worktree tmux AI 工具 开发效率 并行处理 Orchestrate multiple Codex CLI agents in parallel Utilize git worktree for independent task management Leverage tmux sessions for efficient task automation Spawn workers for tasks like issue triage and code refactoring Supports tasks that can be split into independent subtasks Enables parallelism for tasks like fetching issue lists and refactoring modules codex-worker is a CLI agent that orchestrates multiple Codex CLI agents in parallel, each in its own git worktree and tmux session, for efficient task automation.');
