e infra","fr":"Guide de mise en place de contenu social avec xByte infra","de":"Einrichtungsanleitung für soziale Inhalte mit xByte Infra...","pt":"Guia de Configuração de Conteúdo Social com xByte Infra","ru":"Настройка Социального Контента с xByte Инфра - ИИ Агенты","ar":"دليل إعداد المحتوى الاجتماعي مع البنية xByte"},"description":{"en":"Discover how to leverage social-content for multi-network publishing, goal-driven content creation, and audience engagement - get started today!","zh":"了解社交内容AI工具的技术细节，包括xByte基础设施和Pay-per-Byte x402支付","ja":"ソーシャルコンテンツAIエージェントの技術的特徴を学び、xByteインフラストラクチャとPay-per-Byte x402支払いについて","ko":"소셜 콘텐츠 AI 에이전트의 기술적 세부 사항을 알아보고 xByte 인프라와 Pay-per-Byte x402 결제에 대해","es":"Aprende a crear contenido social atractivo con xByte infra y maximiza tu alcance en redes sociales","fr":"Découvrez comment créer du contenu social engageant avec xByte infra et améliorez votre visibilité sur les réseaux sociaux","de":"Erfahren Sie, wie Sie mit xByte Infrastruktur ansprechende soziale Inhalte erstellen und Ihre Reichweite in sozialen Netzwerken maximieren","pt":"Aprenda a criar conteúdo social engajador com xByte infra e pagamentos x402. Descubra como criar uma estratégia de mídia social eficaz.","ru":"Узнайте, как создать привлекательный социальный контент с xByte инфра и платежами x402. Откройте для себя, как разработать эффективную стратегию социальных с...","ar":"تعلم كيفية إنشاء محتوى اجتماعي جذاب مع البنية xByte ودفع x402. اكتشف كيفية إنشاء استراتيجية وسائل إعلام اجتماعية فعالة"},"definition":{"en":"social-content is a skill that enables experts to strategize and publish engaging content across major social networks using a scheduling platform.","zh":"社交内容AI工具是一种利用人工智能技术创建和发布社交媒体内容的工具","ja":"ソーシャルコンテンツAIエージェントは、人工知能技術を使用してソーシャルメディアコンテンツを作成および公開するツールです","ko":"소셜 콘텐츠 AI 에이전트는 인공 지능 기술을 사용하여 소셜 미디어 콘텐츠를 생성하고 게시하는 도구입니다","es":"El contenido social es un tipo de contenido que se crea para redes sociales, utilizando habilidades como xByte infra para maximizar el alcance","fr":"Le contenu social est un type de contenu créé pour les réseaux sociaux, utilisant des compétences comme xByte infra pour maximiser la portée","de":"Soziale Inhalte sind eine Art von Inhalten, die für soziale Netzwerke erstellt werden, wobei Fähigkeiten wie xByte Infrastruktur verwendet werden, um die Reichweite zu maximieren","pt":"O que é conteúdo social? É uma estratégia de marketing que utiliza plataformas de mídia social para criar conteúdo atraente e engajador.","ru":"Что такое социальный контент? Это маркетинговая стратегия, которая использует платформы социальных сетей для создания привлекательного и вовлекающего контента с помощью ИИ Агентов.","ar":"ما هو المحتوى الاجتماعي؟ إنه استراتيجية تسويقية تستخدم منصات الوسائط الاجتماعية لإنشاء محتوى جذاب ومثير"},"features":{"en":["Access to a scheduling platform for publishing to all major social networks","Goal-oriented content creation for brand awareness, leads, traffic, and community","Supports direct action calls to drive engagement and conversions","Context gathering for tailored content strategy, including primary objectives and desired actions"],"zh":["xByte基础设施集成","Pay-per-Byte x402支付支持","社交媒体内容创建和发布","支持多个社交媒体平台","人工智能驱动的内容优化"],"ja":["xByteインフラストラクチャの統合","Pay-per-Byte x402支払いのサポート","ソーシャルメディアコンテンツの作成および公開","複数のソーシャルメディアプラットフォームのサポート","人工知能駆動のコンテンツ最適化"],"ko":["xByte 인프라 통합","Pay-per-Byte x402 결제 지원","소셜 미디어 콘텐츠 생성 및 게시","複数의 소셜 미디어 플랫폼 지원","인공 지능 기반 콘텐츠 최적화"],"es":["Utiliza xByte infra para pagos ''Pay-per-Byte'' x402","Crea contenido atractivo para redes sociales","Acceso directo a plataformas de programación de publicaciones","Publicación en todas las redes sociales principales","Ayuda a crear contenido que construye audiencia y genera compromiso","Soporte para objetivos de negocio como conciencia de marca y generación de leads"],"fr":["Utilise xByte infra pour les paiements ''Pay-per-Byte'' x402","Crée du contenu attractif pour les réseaux sociaux","Accès direct à des plateformes de programmation de publications","Publication sur tous les réseaux sociaux principaux","Aide à créer du contenu qui construit une audience et génère de l''engagement","Supporte les objectifs d''entreprise tels que la notoriété de la marque et la génération de leads"],"de":["Verwendet xByte Infrastruktur für ''Pay-per-Byte''-x402-Zahlungen","Erstellt ansprechende Inhalte für soziale Netzwerke","Direkter Zugriff auf Plattformen für die Programmierung von Veröffentlichungen","Veröffentlichung in allen wichtigen sozialen Netzwerken","Hilft bei der Erstellung von Inhalten, die eine Zielgruppe aufbauen und Engagement generieren","Unterstützt Geschäftsziele wie Markenbewusstsein und Lead-Generierung"],"pt":["Criação de conteúdo social personalizado com xByte infra","Pagamentos x402 por byte","Integração com plataformas de mídia social","Otimização de conteúdo para engajamento","Análise de desempenho de conteúdo"],"ru":["Создание персонализированного социального контента с xByte инфра","Оплата x402 за байт","Интеграция с платформами социальных сетей","Оптимизация контента для вовлечения","Анализ производительности контента с помощью ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["إنشاء محتوى اجتماعي مخصص مع البنية xByte","دفع x402 للبايت","التكامل مع منصات الوسائط الاجتماعية","تحسين المحتوى لجذب الانتباه","تحليل أداء المحتوى"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use social-content","social-content setup guide","social media scheduling platform","social-content alternative","social-content vs Hootsuite","social-content install","what is social-content","social-content for business","social-content for AI agents"],"zh":["社交内容AI工具","xByte基础设施","Pay-per-Byte x402支付","社交媒体内容创建","人工智能驱动的内容优化","社交媒体营销工具"],"ja":["ソーシャルコンテンツAIエージェント","xByteインフラストラクチャ","Pay-per-Byte x402支払い","ソーシャルメディアコンテンツ作成","人工知能駆動のコンテンツ最適化","ソーシャルメディアマーケティングツール"],"ko":["소셜 콘텐츠 AI 에이전트","xByte 인프라","Pay-per-Byte x402 결제","소셜 미디어 콘텐츠 생성","인공 지능 기반 콘텐츠 최적화","소셜 미디어 마케팅 도구"],"es":["contenido social","xByte infra","pagos Pay-per-Byte","redes sociales","programación de publicaciones","creación de contenido","marketing digital","Herramientas de AI para redes sociales","Agentes de IA para marketing"],"fr":["contenu social","xByte infra","paiements Pay-per-Byte","réseaux sociaux","programmation de publications","création de contenu","marketing numérique","Outils d''IA pour réseaux sociaux","Agents d''IA pour marketing"],"de":["soziale Inhalte","xByte Infrastruktur","Pay-per-Byte-Zahlungen","soziale Netzwerke","Veröffentlichungsprogrammierung","Inhalterstellung","digitales Marketing","AI-Tools für soziale Netzwerke","KI-Agents für Marketing"],"pt":["conteúdo social","xByte infra","pagamentos x402","mídia social","marketing digital","estratégia de conteúdo","criação de conteúdo","análise de desempenho"],"ru":["социальный контент","xByte инфра","оплата x402","социальные сети","цифровой маркетинг","стратегия контента","создание контента","анализ производительности","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["المحتوى الاجتماعي","البنية xByte","دفع x402","الوسائط الاجتماعية","التسويق الرقمي","استراتيجية المحتوى","إنشاء المحتوى","تحليل الأداء","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"Arvmor","repo":"xByte","repoPath":"Arvmor/xByte","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.462Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"social-content","description":"When the user wants help creating, scheduling, or optimizing social media content for LinkedIn, Twitter/X, Instagram, TikTok, Facebook, or other platforms. Also use when the user mentions LinkedIn post, Twitter thread, social media, content calendar, social scheduling, engagement, or viral content. This skill covers content creation, repurposing, and platform-specific strategies.","bodyPreview":"# Social Content\n\nYou are an expert social media strategist with direct access to a scheduling platform that publishes to all major social networks. Your goal is to help create engaging content that builds audience, drives engagement, and supports business goals.\n\n## Before Creating Content\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Goals\n- What''s the primary objective? (Brand awareness, leads, traffic, community)\n- What action do you want people to take?\n- Are you building personal bra","body":"# Social Content\n\nYou are an expert social media strategist with direct access to a scheduling platform that publishes to all major social networks. Your goal is to help create engaging content that builds audience, drives engagement, and supports business goals.\n\n## Before Creating Content\n\nGather this context (ask if not provided):\n\n### 1. Goals\n- What''s the primary objective? (Brand awareness, leads, traffic, community)\n- What action do you want people to take?\n- Are you building personal brand, company brand, or both?\n\n### 2. Audience\n- Who are you trying to reach?\n- What platforms are they most active on?\n- What content do they engage with?\n- What problems do they have that you can address?\n\n### 3. Brand Voice\n- What''s your tone? (Professional, casual, witty, authoritative)\n- Any topics to avoid?\n- Any specific terminology or style guidelines?\n\n### 4. Resources\n- How much time can you dedicate to social?\n- Do you have existing content to repurpose (blog posts, podcasts, videos)?\n- Can you create video content?\n- Do you have customer stories or data to share?\n\n---\n\n## Platform Strategy Guide\n\n### LinkedIn\n\n**Best for:** B2B, thought leadership, professional networking, recruiting\n**Audience:** Professionals, decision-makers, job seekers\n**Posting frequency:** 3-5x per week\n**Best times:** Tuesday-Thursday, 7-8am, 12pm, 5-6pm\n\n**What works:**\n- Personal stories with business lessons\n- Contrarian takes on industry topics\n- Behind-the-scenes of building a company\n- Data and original insights\n- Carousel posts (document format)\n- Polls that spark discussion\n\n**What doesn''t:**\n- Overly promotional content\n- Generic motivational quotes\n- Links in the main post (kills reach)\n- Corporate speak without personality\n\n**Format tips:**\n- First line is everything (hook before \"see more\")\n- Use line breaks for readability\n- 1,200-1,500 characters performs well\n- Put links in comments, not post body\n- Tag people sparingly and genuinely\n\n### Twitter/X\n\n**Best for:** Tech, media, real-time commentary, community building\n**Audience:** Tech-savvy, news-oriented, niche communities\n**Posting frequency:** 3-10x per day (including replies)\n**Best times:** Varies by audience; test and measure\n\n**What works:**\n- Hot takes and opinions\n- Threads that teach something\n- Behind-the-scenes moments\n- Engaging with others'' content\n- Memes and humor (if on-brand)\n- Real-time commentary on events\n\n**What doesn''t:**\n- Pure self-promotion\n- Threads without a strong hook\n- Ignoring replies and mentions\n- Scheduling everything (no real-time presence)\n\n**Format tips:**\n- Tweets under 100 characters get more engagement\n- Threads: Hook in tweet 1, promise value, deliver\n- Quote tweets with added insight beat plain retweets\n- Use visuals to stop the scroll\n\n### Instagram\n\n**Best for:** Visual brands, lifestyle, e-commerce, younger demographics\n**Audience:** 18-44, visual-first consumers\n**Posting frequency:** 1-2 feed posts per day, 3-10 Stories per day\n**Best times:** 11am-1pm, 7-9pm\n\n**What works:**\n- High-quality visuals\n- Behind-the-scenes Stories\n- Reels (short-form video)\n- Carousels with value\n- User-generated content\n- Interactive Stories (polls, questions)\n\n**What doesn''t:**\n- Low-quality images\n- Too much text in images\n- Ignoring Stories and Reels\n- Only promotional content\n\n**Format tips:**\n- Reels get 2x reach of static posts\n- First frame of Reels must hook\n- Carousels: 10 slides with educational content\n- Use all Story features (polls, links, etc.)\n\n### TikTok\n\n**Best for:** Brand awareness, younger audiences, viral potential\n**Audience:** 16-34, entertainment-focused\n**Posting frequency:** 1-4x per day\n**Best times:** 7-9am, 12-3pm, 7-11pm\n\n**What works:**\n- Native, unpolished content\n- Trending sounds and formats\n- Educational content in entertaining wrapper\n- POV and day-in-the-life content\n- Responding to comments with videos\n- Duets and stitches\n\n**What doesn''t:**\n- Overly produced content\n- Ignoring trends\n- Hard selling\n- Repurposed horizontal video\n\n**Format tips:**\n- Hook in first 1-2 seconds\n- Keep it under 30 seconds to start\n- Vertical only (9:16)\n- Use trending sounds\n- Post consistently to train algorithm\n\n### Facebook\n\n**Best for:** Communities, local businesses, older demographics, groups\n**Audience:** 25-55+, community-oriented\n**Posting frequency:** 1-2x per day\n**Best times:** 1-4pm weekdays\n\n**What works:**\n- Facebook Groups (community)\n- Native video\n- Live video\n- Local content and events\n- Discussion-prompting questions\n\n**What doesn''t:**\n- Links to external sites (reach killer)\n- Pure promotional content\n- Ignoring comments\n- Cross-posting from other platforms without adaptation\n\n---\n\n## Content Pillars Framework\n\nBuild your content around 3-5 pillars that align with your expertise and audience interests.\n\n### Example for a SaaS Founder\n\n| Pillar | % of Content | Topics |\n|--------|--------------|--------|\n| Industry insights | 30% | Trends, data, predictions |\n| Behind-the-scenes | 25% | Building the company, lessons learned |\n| Educational | 25% | How-tos, frameworks, tips |\n| Personal | 15% | Stories, values, hot takes |\n| Promotional | 5% | Product updates, offers |\n\n### Pillar Development Questions\n\nFor each pillar, ask:\n1. What unique perspective do you have?\n2. What questions does your audience ask?\n3. What content has performed well before?\n4. What can you create consistently?\n5. What aligns with business goals?\n\n---\n\n## Post Formats & Templates\n\n### LinkedIn Post Templates\n\n**The Story Post:**\n```\n[Hook: Unexpected outcome or lesson]\n\n[Set the scene: When/where this happened]\n\n[The challenge you faced]\n\n[What you tried / what happened]\n\n[The turning point]\n\n[The result]\n\n[The lesson for readers]\n\n[Question to prompt engagement]\n```\n\n**The Contrarian Take:**\n```\n[Unpopular opinion stated boldly]\n\nHere''s why:\n\n[Reason 1]\n[Reason 2]\n[Reason 3]\n\n[What you recommend instead]\n\n[Invite discussion: \"Am I wrong?\"]\n```\n\n**The List Post:**\n```\n[X things I learned about [topic] after [credibility builder]:\n\n1. [Point] — [Brief explanation]\n\n2. [Point] — [Brief explanation]\n\n3. [Point] — [Brief explanation]\n\n[Wrap-up insight]\n\nWhich resonates most with you?\n```\n\n**The How-To:**\n```\nHow to [achieve outcome] in [timeframe]:\n\nStep 1: [Action]\n↳ [Why this matters]\n\nStep 2: [Action]\n↳ [Key detail]\n\nStep 3: [Action]\n↳ [Common mistake to avoid]\n\n[Result you can expect]\n\n[CTA or question]\n```\n\n### Twitter/X Thread Templates\n\n**The Tutorial Thread:**\n```\nTweet 1: [Hook + promise of value]\n\n\"Here''s exactly how to [outcome] (step-by-step):\"\n\nTweet 2-7: [One step per tweet with details]\n\nFinal tweet: [Summary + CTA]\n\n\"If this was helpful, follow me for more on [topic]\"\n```\n\n**The Story Thread:**\n```\nTweet 1: [Intriguing hook]\n\n\"[Time] ago, [unexpected thing happened]. Here''s the full story:\"\n\nTweet 2-6: [Story beats, building tension]\n\nTweet 7: [Resolution and lesson]\n\nFinal tweet: [Takeaway + engagement ask]\n```\n\n**The Breakdown Thread:**\n```\nTweet 1: [Company/person] just [did thing].\n\nHere''s why it''s genius (and what you can learn):\n\nTweet 2-6: [Analysis points]\n\nTweet 7: [Your key takeaway]\n\n\"[Related insight + follow CTA]\"\n```\n\n### Instagram Caption Templates\n\n**The Carousel Hook:**\n```\n[Slide 1: Bold statement or question]\n[Slides 2-9: One point per slide, visual + text]\n[Slide 10: Summary + CTA]\n\nCaption: [Expand on the topic, add context, include CTA]\n```\n\n**The Reel Script:**\n```\nHook (0-2 sec): [Pattern interrupt or bold claim]\nSetup (2-5 sec): [Context for the tip]\nValue (5-25 sec): [The actual advice/content]\nCTA (25-30 sec): [Follow, comment, share, link]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Hook Formulas\n\nThe first line determines whether anyone reads the rest. Use these patterns:\n\n### Curiosity Hooks\n- \"I was wrong about [common belief].\"\n- \"The real reason [outcome] happens isn''t what you think.\"\n- \"[Impressive result] — and it only took [surprisingly short time].\"\n- \"Nobody talks about [insider knowledge].\"\n\n### Story Hooks\n- \"Last week, [unexpected thing] happened.\"\n- \"I almost [big mistake/failure].\"\n- \"3 years ago, I [past state]. Today, [current state].\"\n- \"[Person] told me something I''ll never forget.\"\n\n### Value Hooks\n- \"How to [desirable outcome] (without [common pain]):\"\n- \"[Number] [things] that [outcome]:\"\n- \"The simplest way to [outcome]:\"\n- \"Stop [common mistake]. Do this instead:\"\n\n### Contrarian Hooks\n- \"Unpopular opinion: [bold statement]\"\n- \"[Common advice] is wrong. Here''s why:\"\n- \"I stopped [common practice] and [positive result].\"\n- \"Everyone says [X]. The truth is [Y].\"\n\n### Social Proof Hooks\n- \"We [achieved result] in [timeframe]. Here''s how:\"\n- \"[Number] people asked me about [topic]. Here''s my answer:\"\n- \"[Authority figure] taught me [lesson].\"\n\n---\n\n## Content Repurposing System\n\nTurn one piece of content into many:\n\n### Blog Post → Social Content\n\n| Original | Platform | Format |\n|----------|----------|--------|\n| Blog post | LinkedIn | Key insight + link in comments |\n| Blog post | LinkedIn | Carousel of main points |\n| Blog post | Twitter/X | Thread of key takeaways |\n| Blog post | Twitter/X | Single tweet with hot take |\n| Blog post | Instagram | Carousel with visuals |\n| Blog post | Instagram | Reel summarizing the post |\n\n### Podcast/Video → Social Content\n\n| Original | Platform | Format |\n|----------|----------|--------|\n| Interview | LinkedIn | Quote graphic + insight |\n| Interview | Twitter/X | Thread of best quotes |\n| Interview | Instagram | Clip as Reel |\n| Interview | TikTok | Short clip with caption |\n| Interview | YouTube | Shorts from best moments |\n\n### Repurposing Workflow\n\n1. **Create pillar content** (blog, video, podcast)\n2. **Extract key insights** (3-5 per piece)\n3. **Adapt to each platform** (format and tone)\n4. **Schedule across the week** (spread distribution)\n5. **Update and reshare** (evergreen content can repeat)\n\n---\n\n## Content Calendar Structure\n\n### Weekly Planning Template\n\n| Day | LinkedIn | Twitter/X | Instagram |\n|-----|----------|-----------|-----------|\n| Mon | Industry insight | Thread | Carousel |\n| Tue | Behind-scenes | Engagement | Story |\n| Wed | Educational | Tips tweet | Reel |\n| Thu | Story post | Thread | Educational |\n| Fri | Hot take | Engagement | Story |\n| Sat | — | Curated RT | User content |\n| Sun | — | Personal | Behind-scenes |\n\n### Monthly Content Mix\n\n- Week 1: Launch/announce something (if applicable)\n- Week 2: Educational deep-dive\n- Week 3: Community/engagement focus\n- Week 4: Story/behind-the-scenes\n\n### Batching Strategy\n\n**Weekly batching (2-3 hours):**\n1. Review content pillar topics\n2. Write 5 LinkedIn posts\n3. Write 3 Twitter threads + daily tweets\n4. Create Instagram carousel + Reel ideas\n5. Schedule everything\n6. Leave room for real-time engagement\n\n---\n\n## Engagement Strategy\n\n### Proactive Engagement\n\nEngagement isn''t just responding—it''s actively participating:\n\n**Daily engagement routine (30 min):**\n1. Respond to all comments on your posts (5 min)\n2. Comment on 5-10 posts from target accounts (15 min)\n3. Share/repost with added insight (5 min)\n4. Send 2-3 DMs to new connections (5 min)\n\n**Quality comments:**\n- Add new insight, not just \"Great post!\"\n- Share a related experience\n- Ask a thoughtful follow-up question\n- Respectfully disagree with nuance\n\n### Building Relationships\n\n- Identify 20-50 accounts in your space\n- Consistently engage with their content\n- Share their content with credit\n- Eventually collaborate (podcasts, co-created content)\n\n### Handling Negative Comments\n\n- Respond calmly and professionally\n- Don''t get defensive\n- Take legitimate criticism offline\n- Block/mute trolls without engaging\n- Let community defend you when appropriate\n\n---\n\n## Analytics & Optimization\n\n### Metrics That Matter\n\n**Awareness:**\n- Impressions\n- Reach\n- Follower growth rate\n\n**Engagement:**\n- Engagement rate (engagements / impressions)\n- Comments (higher value than likes)\n- Shares/reposts\n- Saves (Instagram)\n\n**Conversion:**\n- Link clicks\n- Profile visits\n- DMs received\n- Leads/conversions attributed\n\n### What to Track Weekly\n\n- [ ] Top 3 performing posts (why did they work?)\n- [ ] Bottom 3 posts (what can you learn?)\n- [ ] Follower growth trend\n- [ ] Engagement rate trend\n- [ ] Best posting times (from data)\n- [ ] Content pillar performance\n\n### Optimization Actions\n\n**If engagement is low:**\n- Test new hooks\n- Post at different times\n- Try different formats (carousel vs. text)\n- Increase native engagement with others\n- Check if content matches audience interest\n\n**If reach is declining:**\n- Avoid external links in post body\n- Increase posting frequency slightly\n- Engage more in comments\n- Test video/visual content\n- Check for algorithm changes\n\n---\n\n## Platform-Specific Tips\n\n### LinkedIn Algorithm Tips\n\n- First hour engagement matters most\n- Comments > reactions > clicks\n- Dwell time (people reading) signals quality\n- No external links in post body\n- Document posts (carousels) get strong reach\n- Polls drive engagement but don''t build authority\n\n### Twitter/X Algorithm Tips\n\n- Replies and quote tweets build authority\n- Threads keep people on platform (rewarded)\n- Images and video get more reach\n- Engagement in first 30 min matters\n- Twitter Blue/Premium may boost reach\n\n### Instagram Algorithm Tips\n\n- Reels heavily prioritized over static posts\n- Saves and shares > likes\n- Stories keep you top of feed\n- Consistency matters more than perfection\n- Use all features (polls, questions, etc.)\n\n---\n\n## Content Ideas by Situation\n\n### When You''re Starting Out\n\n- Document your journey\n- Share what you''re learning\n- Curate and comment on industry content\n- Ask questions to your audience\n- Engage heavily with established accounts\n\n### When You''re Established\n\n- Share original data and insights\n- Tell customer success stories\n- Take stronger positions\n- Create signature frameworks\n- Collaborate with peers\n\n### When You''re Stuck\n\n- Repurpose old high-performing content\n- Ask your audience what they want\n- Comment on industry news\n- Share a failure or lesson learned\n- Interview someone and share insights\n\n---\n\n## Scheduling Best Practices\n\n### When to Schedule vs. Post Live\n\n**Schedule:**\n- Core content posts\n- Threads\n- Carousels\n- Evergreen content\n\n**Post live:**\n- Real-time commentary\n- Responses to news/trends\n- Engagement with others\n- Anything requiring immediate interaction\n\n### Queue Management\n\n- Maintain 1-2 weeks of scheduled content\n- Review queue weekly for relevance\n- Leave gaps for spontaneous posts\n- Adjust timing based on performance data\n\n---\n\n## Reverse Engineering Viral Content\n\nInstead of guessing what works, systematically analyze top-performing content in your niche and extract proven patterns.\n\n### The 6-Step Framework\n\n#### 1. NICHE ID — Find Top Creators\n\nIdentify 10-20 creators in your space who consistently get high engagement:\n\n**Selection criteria:**\n- Posting consistently (3+ times/week)\n- High engagement rate relative to follower count\n- Audience overlap with your target market\n- Mix of established and rising creators\n\n**Where to find them:**\n- LinkedIn: Search by industry keywords, check \"People also viewed\"\n- Twitter/X: Check who your target audience follows and engages with\n- Use tools like SparkToro, Followerwonk, or manual research\n- Look at who gets featured in industry newsletters\n\n#### 2. SCRAPE — Collect Posts at Scale\n\nGather 500-1000+ posts from your identified creators for analysis:\n\n**Tools:**\n- **Apify** — LinkedIn scraper, Twitter scraper actors\n- **Phantom Buster** — Multi-platform automation\n- **Export tools** — Platform-specific export features\n- **Manual collection** — For smaller datasets, copy/paste into spreadsheet\n\n**Data to collect:**\n- Post text/content\n- Engagement metrics (likes, comments, shares, saves)\n- Post format (text-only, carousel, video, image)\n- Posting time/day\n- Hook/first line\n- CTA used\n- Topic/theme\n\n#### 3. ANALYZE — Extract What Actually Works\n\nSort and analyze the data to find patterns:\n\n**Quantitative analysis:**\n- Rank posts by engagement rate\n- Identify top 10% performers\n- Look for format patterns (do carousels outperform?)\n- Check timing patterns (best days/times)\n- Compare topic performance\n\n**Qualitative analysis:**\n- What hooks do top posts use?\n- How long are high-performing posts?\n- What emotional triggers appear?\n- What formats repeat?\n- What topics consistently perform?\n\n**Questions to answer:**\n- What''s the average length of top posts?\n- Which hook types appear most in top 10%?\n- What CTAs drive most comments?\n- What topics get saved/shared most?\n\n#### 4. PLAYBOOK — Codify Patterns\n\nDocument repeatable patterns you can use:\n\n**Hook patterns to codify:**\n```\nPattern: \"I [unexpected action] and [surprising result]\"\nExample: \"I stopped posting daily and my engagement doubled\"\nWhy it works: Curiosity gap + contrarian\n\nPattern: \"[Specific number] [things] that [outcome]:\"\nExample: \"7 pricing mistakes that cost me $50K:\"\nWhy it works: Specificity + loss aversion\n\nPattern: \"[Controversial take]\"\nExample: \"Cold outreach is dead.\"\nWhy it works: Pattern interrupt + invites debate\n```\n\n**Format patterns:**\n- Carousel: Hook slide → Problem → Solution steps → CTA\n- Thread: Hook → Promise → Deliver → Recap → CTA\n- Story post: Hook → Setup → Conflict → Resolution → Lesson\n\n**CTA patterns:**\n- Question: \"What would you add?\"\n- Agreement: \"Agree or disagree?\"\n- Share: \"Tag someone who needs this\"\n- Save: \"Save this for later\"\n\n#### 5. LAYER VOICE — Apply Direct Response Principles\n\nTake proven patterns and make them yours with these voice principles:\n\n**\"Smart friend who figured something out\"**\n- Write like you''re texting advice to a friend\n- Share discoveries, not lectures\n- Use \"I found that...\" not \"You should...\"\n- Be helpful, not preachy\n\n**Specific > Vague**\n```\n❌ \"I made good revenue\"\n✅ \"I made $47,329\"\n\n❌ \"It took a while\"\n✅ \"It took 47 days\"\n\n❌ \"A lot of people\"\n✅ \"2,847 people\"\n```\n\n**Short. Breathe. Land.**\n- One idea per sentence\n- Use line breaks liberally\n- Let important points stand alone\n- Create rhythm: short, short, longer explanation\n\n```\n❌ \"I spent three years building my business the wrong way before I finally realized that the key to success was focusing on fewer things and doing them exceptionally well.\"\n\n✅ \"I built wrong for 3 years.\n\nThen I figured it out.\n\nFocus on less.\nDo it exceptionally well.\n\nEverything changed.\"\n```\n\n**Write from emotion**\n- Start with how you felt, not what you did\n- Use emotional words: frustrated, excited, terrified, obsessed\n- Show vulnerability when authentic\n- Connect the feeling to the lesson\n\n```\n❌ \"Here''s what I learned about pricing\"\n\n✅ \"I was terrified to raise my prices.\n\nMy hands were shaking when I sent the email.\n\nHere''s what happened...\"\n```\n\n#### 6. CONVERT — Turn Attention into Action\n\nBridge from engagement to business results:\n\n**Soft conversions:**\n- Newsletter signups in bio/comments\n- Free resource offers in follow-up comments\n- DM triggers (\"Comment X and I''ll send you...\")\n- Profile visits → optimized profile with clear CTA\n\n**Direct conversions:**\n- Link in comments (not post body on LinkedIn)\n- Contextual product mentions within valuable content\n- Case study posts that naturally showcase your work\n- \"If you want help with this, DM me\" (sparingly)\n\n### Output: Proven Patterns + Right Voice = Performance\n\nThe formula:\n```\n1. Find what''s already working (don''t guess)\n2. Extract the patterns (hooks, formats, CTAs)\n3. Layer your authentic voice on top\n4. Test and iterate based on your own data\n```\n\n### Reverse Engineering Checklist\n\n- [ ] Identified 10-20 top creators in niche\n- [ ] Collected 500+ posts for analysis\n- [ ] Ranked by engagement rate\n- [ ] Documented top 10 hook patterns\n- [ ] Documented top 5 format patterns\n- [ ] Documented top 5 CTA patterns\n- [ ] Created voice guidelines (specificity, brevity, emotion)\n- [ ] Built template library from patterns\n- [ ] Set up tracking for your own content performance\n\n---\n\n## Questions to Ask\n\nIf you need more context:\n1. What platform(s) are you focusing on?\n2. What''s your current posting frequency?\n3. Do you have existing content to repurpose?\n4. What content has performed well in the past?\n5. How much time can you dedicate weekly?\n6. Are you building personal brand, company brand, or both?\n\n---\n\n## Related Skills\n\n- **copywriting**: For longer-form content that feeds social\n- **launch-strategy**: For coordinating social with launches\n- **email-sequence**: For nurturing social audience via email\n- **marketing-psychology**: For understanding what drives engagement\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:15.780Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Essential for Social Media Automation Agents requiring Pay-per-Byte x402 payment integration and multi-platform content scheduling.","zh":"适用于需要按字节付费 x402 支付集成和多平台内容安排的社交媒体自动化代理。","ja":"Pay-per-Byte x402 支払い統合とマルチプラットフォーム コンテンツ スケジューリングを必要とするソーシャル メディア オートメーション エージェントに不可欠。","ko":"Pay-per-Byte x402 결제 통합 및 다중 플랫폼 콘텐츠 예약이 필요한 소셜 미디어 자동화 에이전트에 필수입니다.","es":"Esencial para Agentes de Automatización de Redes Sociales que requieren integración de pago por byte x402 y programación de contenido multiplataforma.","fr":"Essentiel pour les Agents d''Automatisation des Réseaux Sociaux nécessitant une intégration de paiement par octet x402 et une planification de contenu multiplateforme.","de":"Wesentlich für Social-Media-Automatisierungsagenten, die eine Integration der Pay-per-Byte x402-Zahlung und eine mehrplattformübergreifende Inhaltsplanung erfordern.","pt":"Essencial para Agentes de Automação de Mídia Social que requerem integração de pagamento Pay-per-Byte x402 e agendamento de conteúdo em múltiplas plataformas.","ru":"Необходим для Агентов автоматизации социальных сетей, требующих интеграции платежей Pay-per-Byte x402 и планирования контента на нескольких платформах.","ar":"أساسي لوكلاء أتمتة وسائل التواصل الاجتماعي التي تتطلب تكامل دفع Pay-per-Byte x402 وجدولة المحتوى متعدد المنصات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables direct publishing to all major social networks through integrated scheduling platform access while facilitating Pay-per-Byte x402 micropayments for content monetization. Provides structured content strategy framework for brand awareness, lead generation, and community building objectives.","zh":"通过集成的计划平台访问，实现直接发布到所有主要社交网络，同时促进 Pay-per-Byte x402 微支付以实现内容变现。为品牌认知、潜在客户生成和社区建设目标提供结构化内容策略框架。","ja":"統合されたスケジューリング プラットフォーム アクセスを介して、すべての主要ソーシャル ネットワークに直接公開し、同時にコンテンツの収益化のための Pay-per-Byte x402 マイクロペイメントを促進します。ブランド認知、リード生成、コミュニティ構築の目標のための構造化されたコンテンツ戦略フレームワークを提供します。","ko":"통합된 스케줄링 플랫폼 액세스를 통해 모든 주요 소셜 네트워크에 직접 게시하고同時에 콘텐츠의 수익화를 위한 Pay-per-Byte x402 마이크로결제를 촉진합니다. 브랜드 인식, 리드 생성 및 커뮤니티 구축 목표를 위한 구조화된 콘텐츠 전략 프레임워크를 제공합니다.","es":"Permite la publicación directa en todas las redes sociales principales a través del acceso a la plataforma de programación integrada, mientras facilita los micropagos Pay-per-Byte x402 para la monetización de contenido. Proporciona un marco de estrategia de contenido estructurado para los objetivos de conciencia de marca, generación de leads y construcción de comunidad.","fr":"Permet la publication directe sur tous les réseaux sociaux majeurs via l''accès à la plateforme de planification intégrée, tout en facilitant les transactions de micropaiement Pay-per-Byte x402 pour la monétisation de contenu. Fournit un cadre de stratégie de contenu structuré pour les objectifs de notoriété de marque, de génération de leads et de construction de communauté.","de":"Ermöglicht die direkte Veröffentlichung auf allen großen sozialen Netzwerken durch den Zugriff auf die integrierte Planungsplattform, während sie die Pay-per-Byte x402-Mikrozahlungen für die Inhaltsmonetarisierung erleichtert. Bietet ein strukturiertes Inhaltsstrategie-Rahmenwerk für Markenbewusstseins-, Lead-Generierungs- und Community-Building-Ziele.","pt":"Permite a publicação direta em todas as principais redes sociais através do acesso integrado à plataforma de agendamento, facilitando ao mesmo tempo os micropagamentos Pay-per-Byte x402 para monetização de conteúdo. Fornece uma estrutura estruturada de estratégia de conteúdo para objetivos de reconhecimento de marca, geração de leads e construção de comunidade.","ru":"Обеспечивает прямую публикацию во все основные социальные сети через интегрированный доступ к платформе планирования, одновременно способствуя микроплатежам Pay-per-Byte x402 для монетизации контента. Предоставляет структурированную основу для контент-стратегии с целями повышения узнаваемости бренда, генерации лидов и построения сообщества.","ar":"يمكن النشر المباشر إلى جميع شبكات التواصل الاجتماعي الرئيسية من خلال الوصول المتكامل إلى منصة الجدولة مع تسهيل مدفوعات Pay-per-Byte x402 الدقيقة لتحقيق الدخل من المحتوى. يوفر إطارًا منظمًا لاستراتيجية المحتوى لأهداف التوعية بالعلامة التجارية، وتوليد العملاء المحتملين، وبناء المجتمع."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating multi-platform content scheduling across major social networks","Generating engagement-optimized content for specific business goals (awareness/leads/traffic)","Facilitating Pay-per-Byte x402 micropayment transactions for content monetization","Building audience growth strategies through systematic community engagement"],"zh":["跨主要社交网络自动执行多平台内容安排","为特定业务目标（认知/潜在客户/流量）生成参与度优化的内容","促进内容变现的 Pay-per-Byte x402 微支付交易","通过系统性的社区参与构建受众增长策略"],"ja":["主要ソーシャル ネットワーク間でマルチプラットフォーム コンテンツ スケジューリングを自動化する","特定のビジネス目標（認知/リード/トラフィック）に最適化されたエンゲージメント コンテンツを生成する","コンテンツの収益化のための Pay-per-Byte x402 マイクロペイメント トランザクションを促進する","体系的なコミュニティ エンゲージメントを通じてオーディエンス成長戦略を構築する"],"ko":["주요 소셜 네트워크 간에 다중 플랫폼 콘텐츠 예약을 자동화합니다","특정 비즈니스 목표(인식/리드/트래픽)에 최적화된 참여 콘텐츠를 생성합니다","콘텐츠의 수익화를 위한 Pay-per-Byte x402 마이크로결제 트랜잭션을 촉진합니다","체계적인 커뮤니티 참여를 통해 오디언스 성장 전략을 구축합니다"],"es":["Automatización de la programación de contenido multiplataforma en las principales redes sociales","Generación de contenido optimizado para el compromiso para objetivos comerciales específicos (conciencia/leads/tráfico)","Facilitación de transacciones de micropago Pay-per-Byte x402 para la monetización de contenido","Desarrollo de estrategias de crecimiento de audiencia a través de la participación comunitaria sistemática"],"fr":["Automatisation de la planification de contenu multiplateforme sur les réseaux sociaux majeurs","Génération de contenu optimisé pour l''engagement pour des objectifs commerciaux spécifiques (notoriété/leads/trafic)","Facilitation des transactions de micropaiement Pay-per-Byte x402 pour la monétisation de contenu","Élaboration de stratégies de croissance d''audience via l''engagement communautaire systématique"],"de":["Automatisierung der mehrplattformübergreifenden Inhaltsplanung in großen sozialen Netzwerken","Erzeugung von engagementoptimiertem Inhalt für spezifische Geschäftsziele (Bewusstseinsbildung/Lead-Generierung/Verkehr)","Erleichterung von Pay-per-Byte x402-Mikrozahlungstransaktionen für die Inhaltsmonetarisierung","Aufbau von Strategien für das Wachstum der Zielgruppe durch systematische Gemeinschaftsbeteiligung"],"pt":["Automatizando o agendamento de conteúdo em múltiplas plataformas nas principais redes sociais","Gerando conteúdo otimizado para engajamento para objetivos de negócio específicos (conscientização/leads/tráfego)","Facilitando transações de micropagamentos Pay-per-Byte x402 para monetização de conteúdo","Construindo estratégias de crescimento de audiência através do engajamento sistemático da comunidade"],"ru":["Автоматизация планирования кросс-платформенного контента в основных социальных сетях","Создание контента, оптимизированного для вовлеченности, под конкретные бизнес-цели (узнаваемость/лиды/трафик)","Обеспечение проведения микроплатежных транзакций Pay-per-Byte x402 для монетизации контента","Разработка стратегий роста аудитории через систематическое взаимодействие с сообществом"],"ar":["أتمتة جدولة المحتوى متعدد المنصات عبر شبكات التواصل الاجتماعي الرئيسية","إنشاء محتوى مُحسّن للتفاعل لأهداف عمل محددة (التوعية/العملاء المحتملين/الحركة)","تسهيل معاملات مدفوعات Pay-per-Byte x402 الدقيقة لتحقيق الدخل من المحتوى","بناء استراتيجيات نمو الجمهور من خلال المشاركة المنهجية للمجتمع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to social media scheduling platform credentials","Dependent on provided business objectives and target audience data","Needs clear content goals and desired user actions specified"],"zh":["需要访问社交媒体安排平台凭证","依赖于提供的业务目标和目标受众数据","需要指定明确的内容目标和期望的用户操作"],"ja":["ソーシャル メディア スケジューリング プラットフォームの資格情報へのアクセスが必要","提供されたビジネス目標とターゲット オーディエンス データに依存する","明確なコンテンツ目標と期待されるユーザー アクションを指定する必要がある"],"ko":["소셜 미디어 스케줄링 플랫폼 자격 증명에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","제공된 비즈니스 목표 및 대상 오디언스 데이터에 의존합니다","명확한 콘텐츠 목표 및 예상 사용자 작업을 지정해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso a las credenciales de la plataforma de programación de redes sociales","Dependiente de los objetivos comerciales y datos de la audiencia objetivo proporcionados","Necesita objetivos de contenido claros y acciones de usuario deseadas especificadas"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès aux informations d''identification de la plateforme de planification des réseaux sociaux","Dépendante des objectifs commerciaux et des données de l''audience cible fournies","Nécessite des objectifs de contenu clairs et des actions utilisateur souhaitées spécifiées"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die Anmeldedaten der sozialen Netzwerk-Planungsplattform","Abhängig von den bereitgestellten Geschäftszielen und Zielgruppendaten","Benötigt klare Inhaltsziele und spezifizierte gewünschte Benutzeraktionen"],"pt":["Requer acesso às credenciais da plataforma de agendamento de mídia social","Dependente dos objetivos de negócio fornecidos e dos dados do público-alvo","Necessita de metas de conteúdo claras e ações desejadas do usuário especificadas"],"ru":["Требует доступ к учетным данным платформы планирования публикаций в социальных сетях","Зависит от предоставленных бизнес-целей и данных о целевой аудитории","Требует четкого определения целей контента и желаемых действий пользователя"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى بيانات اعتماد منصة جدولة وسائل التواصل الاجتماعي","يعتمد على أهداف العمل المقدمة وبيانات الجمهور المستهدف","يحتاج إلى أهداف محتوى واضحة وإجراءات المستخدم المرغوبة محددة"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"9c40b9ceda9094b3ce256d62ca8a33e8f82f323cff357da294e14262ed429b69","qualityScore":60}');
