ackend Patternsは会話処理、メモリ抽出、LangGraph統合を実現するAI開発技術です","ko":"Omi Backend Patterns는 대화 처리, 메모리 추출 및 LangGraph 통합을 구현하는 AI 개발 기술입니다","es":"¿Qué es un patrón de backend de Omi? Un conjunto de pautas para trabajar con el backend de Omi, incluyendo procesamiento de conversaciones y extracción de memorias","fr":"Qu''est-ce qu''un modèle de backend Omi? Un ensemble de conseils pour travailler avec le backend Omi, notamment le traitement des conversations et l''extraction des mémoires","de":"Was ist ein Omi-Backend-Muster? Eine Sammlung von Richtlinien zur Arbeit mit dem Omi-Backend, einschließlich Konversationsverarbeitung und Erinnerungsextraktion","pt":"O Omi Backend Patterns é um conjunto de padrões para trabalhar com o Omi backend, incluindo processamento de conversas e integração com LangGraph","ru":"Шаблоны Omi Backend - это набор шаблонов для работы с Omi backend, включая обработку разговоров и интеграцию с LangGraph для ИИ Агентов","ar":"أنماط Omi Backend هي مجموعة من الأنماط للعمل مع.backend Omi ، بما في ذلك معالجة المحادثات وتكامل LangGraph لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"},"features":{"en":["Provides conversation processing guidance for backend Python code in `backend/`","Supports implementing new API endpoints for LangGraph integration","Enables memory extraction and chat system development with Firestore, Pinecone, or Redis","Offers integration with LangGraph for advanced chat functionality","Works with Redis for efficient data storage and retrieval","Facilitates conversation processing and transcription for AI wearables"],"zh":["会话处理","内存提取","LangGraph集成","Firestore支持","Pinecone支持","Redis支持"],"ja":["会話処理","メモリ抽出","LangGraph統合","Firestoreサポート","Pineconeサポート","Redisサポート"],"ko":["대화 처리","메모리 추출","LangGraph 통합","Firestore 지원","Pinecone 지원","Redis 지원"],"es":["Procesamiento de conversaciones con Python","Integración con LangGraph para la extracción de memorias","Implementación de nuevos puntos de terminación de API","Trabajo con Firestore, Pinecone o Redis","Extracción de memorias y procesamiento de conversaciones","Integración con el sistema de chat de LangGraph"],"fr":["Traitement des conversations avec Python","Intégration avec LangGraph pour l''extraction des mémoires","Mise en œuvre de nouveaux points de terminaison d''API","Travail avec Firestore, Pinecone ou Redis","Extraction des mémoires et traitement des conversations","Intégration avec le système de chat de LangGraph"],"de":["Konversationsverarbeitung mit Python","Integration mit LangGraph für die Erinnerungsextraktion","Implementierung neuer API-Endpunkte","Arbeit mit Firestore, Pinecone oder Redis","Erinnerungsextraktion und Konversationsverarbeitung","Integration mit dem LangGraph-Chat-System"],"pt":["Processamento de conversas com LangGraph","Integração com Firestore, Pinecone e Redis","Implementação de novos endpoints de API","Extração de memória e processamento de conversas","Trabalho com backend Python em `backend/`"],"ru":["Обработка разговоров с LangGraph для ИИ Агентов","Интеграция с Firestore, Pinecone и Redis","Реализация новых точек API","Извлечение памяти и обработка разговоров","Работа с backend Python в `backend/` для ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["معالجة المحادثات مع LangGraph لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","التكامل مع Firestore و Pinecone و Redis","تنفيذ نقاط API جديدة","استخراج الذاكرة ومعالجة المحادثات","العمل مع backend Python في `backend/` لأدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use omi-backend-patterns","omi-backend-patterns setup guide","omi-backend-patterns alternative","omi-backend-patterns vs LangGraph","omi-backend-patterns install","omi-backend-patterns conversation processing","omi-backend-patterns LangGraph integration","omi-backend-patterns Redis setup","omi-backend-patterns Firestore development","omi-backend-patterns AI wearables development"],"zh":["Omi Backend Patterns","AI开发","会话处理","内存提取","LangGraph","Firestore","Pinecone","Redis","AIエージェント"],"ja":["Omi Backend Patterns","AI開発","会話処理","メモリ抽出","LangGraph","Firestore","Pinecone","Redis","AIエージェント"],"ko":["Omi Backend Patterns","AI 개발","대화 처리","메모리 추출","LangGraph","Firestore","Pinecone","Redis","AI 에이전트"],"es":["patrones de backend de Omi","procesamiento de conversaciones con Python","integración con LangGraph","extracción de memorias","implementación de API","trabajo con Firestore","desarrollo de backend con Omi","herramientas de AI para desarrolladores","agentes de AI para backend"],"fr":["modèles de backend Omi","traitement des conversations avec Python","intégration avec LangGraph","extraction des mémoires","mise en œuvre d''API","travail avec Firestore","développement de backend avec Omi","outils d''IA pour les développeurs","agents d''IA pour le backend"],"de":["Omi-Backend-Muster","Konversationsverarbeitung mit Python","Integration mit LangGraph","Erinnerungsextraktion","Implementierung von API","Arbeit mit Firestore","Entwicklung von Backend mit Omi","KI-Tools für Entwickler","KI-Agents für das Backend"],"pt":["Omi Backend Patterns","processamento de conversas","LangGraph","Firestore","Pinecone","Redis","backend Python","desenvolvimento de IA","ferramentas de IA"],"ru":["Шаблоны Omi Backend","обработка разговоров","LangGraph","Firestore","Pinecone","Redis","backend Python","разработка ИИ","ИИ Агенты","инструменты ИИ"],"ar":["أنماط Omi Backend","معالجة المحادثات","LangGraph","Firestore","Pinecone","Redis","backend Python","برمجة الذكاء الاصطناعي","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير الذكاء الاصطناعي"]}},"owner":"BasedHardware","repo":"omi","repoPath":"BasedHardware/omi","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"omi-backend-patterns","description":"Omi backend patterns conversation processing memory extraction chat system LangGraph FastAPI Firestore Pinecone Redis","bodyPreview":"# Omi Backend Patterns Skill\n\nThis skill provides guidance for working with the Omi backend, including conversation processing, memory extraction, chat system, and LangGraph integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Working on backend Python code in `backend/`\n- Implementing new API endpoints\n- Processing conversations or extracting memories\n- Working with the LangGraph chat system\n- Integrating with Firestore, Pinecone, or Redis\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Conversation Processing\n\nThe conv","body":"# Omi Backend Patterns Skill\n\nThis skill provides guidance for working with the Omi backend, including conversation processing, memory extraction, chat system, and LangGraph integration.\n\n## When to Use\n\nUse this skill when:\n- Working on backend Python code in `backend/`\n- Implementing new API endpoints\n- Processing conversations or extracting memories\n- Working with the LangGraph chat system\n- Integrating with Firestore, Pinecone, or Redis\n\n## Key Patterns\n\n### Conversation Processing\n\nThe conversation processing pipeline follows this flow:\n\n1. **Audio arrives via WebSocket** (`/v4/listen`)\n2. **Transcription** via Deepgram/Soniox/Speechmatics\n3. **Conversation creation** in Firestore (status: \"in_progress\")\n4. **Processing trigger** via `POST /v1/conversations` or timeout\n5. **LLM extraction** of structured data:\n   - Title and overview\n   - Action items\n   - Calendar events\n   - Memories (user facts)\n6. **Storage** in Firestore and Pinecone\n\n**Key Function**: `utils/conversations/process_conversation.py::process_conversation()`\n\n### Memory Extraction\n\nMemories are extracted from conversations using LLM:\n\n```python\nfrom utils.llm.conversation_processing import _extract_memories\n\nmemories = await _extract_memories(\n    transcript=transcript,\n    existing_memories=existing_memories,\n)\n```\n\n**Categories**: personal, health, work, relationships, preferences\n\n### Chat System Architecture\n\nThe chat system uses LangGraph for routing:\n\n1. **Classification**: `requires_context()` determines path\n2. **Simple Path**: Direct LLM response (no context needed)\n3. **Agentic Path**: Full tool access with LangGraph ReAct agent\n4. **Persona Path**: Persona app responses\n\n**Key File**: `utils/retrieval/graph.py`\n\n### Module Hierarchy\n\n**CRITICAL**: Always follow the import hierarchy:\n\n1. `database/` - Data access (lowest)\n2. `utils/` - Business logic\n3. `routers/` - API endpoints\n4. `main.py` - Application entry\n\n**Never import from higher levels in lower levels!**\n\n### Database Patterns\n\n- **Firestore**: Primary database for conversations, memories, users\n- **Pinecone**: Vector embeddings for semantic search\n- **Redis**: Caching (speech profiles, enabled apps, user names)\n- **GCS**: Binary files (audio, photos, speech profiles)\n\n### API Endpoint Patterns\n\n- Use FastAPI routers in `routers/`\n- Keep routers thin - business logic in `utils/`\n- Use dependency injection for auth\n- Return consistent error formats\n\n## Common Tasks\n\n### Adding a New API Endpoint\n\n1. Create router function in appropriate `routers/*.py`\n2. Add business logic in `utils/`\n3. Use database functions from `database/`\n4. Follow error handling patterns\n5. Add to router in `main.py`\n\n### Processing Conversations\n\n1. Use `process_conversation()` from `utils/conversations/process_conversation.py`\n2. Handle extraction results\n3. Store in Firestore and Pinecone\n4. Trigger app webhooks if needed\n\n### Adding a Chat Tool\n\n1. Create tool function in `utils/retrieval/tools/`\n2. Use `@tool` decorator from LangChain\n3. Add to tool loading in `utils/retrieval/tools/app_tools.py`\n4. Tool will be available in agentic chat path\n\n## Related Documentation\n\n**The `docs/` folder is the single source of truth for all user-facing documentation, deployed at [docs.omi.me](https://docs.omi.me/).**\n\n- **Backend Deep Dive**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/backend_deepdive.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/backend_deepdive)\n- **Chat System**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/chat_system.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/chat_system)\n- **Data Storage**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/StoringConversations.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/StoringConversations)\n- **Transcription**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/transcription.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/transcription)\n- **Backend Setup**: `docs/doc/developer/backend/Backend_Setup.mdx` - [View online](https://docs.omi.me/doc/developer/backend/Backend_Setup)\n- **Backend Architecture**: `.cursor/rules/backend-architecture.mdc`\n\n## Related Cursor Resources\n\n### Rules\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-architecture.mdc` - System architecture and module hierarchy\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-api-patterns.mdc` - FastAPI router patterns\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-database-patterns.mdc` - Database storage patterns\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-llm-patterns.mdc` - LLM integration patterns\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-testing.mdc` - Testing patterns\n- `.cursor/rules/backend-imports.mdc` - Import rules\n- `.cursor/rules/memory-management.mdc` - Memory management\n\n### Subagents\n- `.cursor/agents/backend-api-developer/` - Uses this skill for API development\n- `.cursor/agents/backend-llm-engineer/` - Uses this skill for LLM integration\n- `.cursor/agents/backend-database-engineer/` - Uses this skill for database work\n\n### Commands\n- `/backend-setup` - Uses this skill for setup guidance\n- `/backend-test` - Uses this skill for testing patterns\n- `/backend-deploy` - Uses this skill for deployment patterns\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:54.176Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for AI Agents needing advanced conversation processing and LangGraph integration capabilities in Python","zh":"适合需要高级对话处理和 LangGraph 集成能力的 AI 代理，使用 Python","ja":"Python を使用して高度な会話処理と LangGraph 統合機能が必要な AI エージェントに最適","ko":"Python을 사용하여 고급 대화 처리 및 LangGraph 통합 기능이 필요한 AI 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de IA que necesitan capacidades de procesamiento de conversación avanzadas y de integración con LangGraph en Python","fr":"Parfait pour les agents IA qui ont besoin de capacités de traitement de conversation avancées et d''intégration avec LangGraph en Python","de":"Perfekt für KI-Agents, die erweiterte Konversationsverarbeitungsfähigkeiten und LangGraph-Integration in Python benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de IA que necessitam de processamento de conversa avançado e capacidades de integração com LangGraph em Python","ru":"Идеально для ИИ-агентов, требующих передовой обработки разговоров и возможностей интеграции с LangGraph в Python","ar":"مثالي لعميل الذكاء الاصطناعي الذي يحتاج إلى معالجة محادثة متقدمة وقدرات التكامل مع LangGraph في Python"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to process conversations, extract memories, and integrate with LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone, or Redis, using Python backend code","zh":"赋予代理处理对话、提取记忆并与 LangGraph、Firestore、Pinecone 或 Redis 集成的能力，使用 Python 后端代码","ja":"エージェントが会話を処理し、記憶を抽出し、LangGraph、Firestore、Pinecone、または Redis と統合する機能を提供する、Python バックエンド コードを使用","ko":"Python 백엔드 코드를 사용하여 에이전트가 대화를 처리하고 기억을 추출하며 LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone 또는 Redis와 통합할 수 있는 기능을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a procesar conversaciones, extraer recuerdos e integrarse con LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone o Redis, utilizando código de backend en Python","fr":"Permet aux agents de traiter les conversations, d''extraire des souvenirs et de s''intégrer avec LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone ou Redis, en utilisant du code backend Python","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Konversationen zu verarbeiten, Erinnerungen zu extrahieren und sich mit LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone oder Redis zu integrieren, indem Python-Backend-Code verwendet wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a processar conversas, extrair memórias e integrar com LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone ou Redis, usando código Python de backend","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обрабатывать разговоры, извлекать воспоминания и интегрироваться с LangGraph, Firestore, Pinecone или Redis, используя код Python бэкенда","ar":"يم