nt IA qui facilite l''examen des PRs dans Razorpay/blade","de":"review-changes ist ein IA-Agent, der die Überprüfung von PRs in Razorpay/blade erleichtert","pt":"O review-changes é uma ferramenta de revisão de código que automatiza a verificação de alterações no repositório Razorpay/blade","ru":"ИИ Агент review-changes - это инструмент для автоматизации проверки изменений в репозитории Razorpay/blade","ar":"أداة مراجعة التغييرات review-changes هي أداة لتحديث التغييرات في مستودع Razorpay/blade"},"features":{"en":["Fetches diffs for PRs in the razorpay/blade repository","Checks CI status for PRs","Extracts Storybook preview URLs","Supports headed and headless browser modes","Utilizes Git for repository interactions","Integrates with Cursor''s AskQuestion tool for clarifications"],"zh":["支持 Git 代码审查","集成 Storybook 预览 URL","自动检查 CI 状态","支持 UI 审查","支持headed浏览器模式","提供代码 diff 功能"],"ja":["Git コードレビューをサポート","Storybook プレビュー URL を統合","CI 状態を自動で確認","UI レビューをサポート","headed ブラウザモードをサポート","コード diff 機能を提供"],"ko":["Git 코드 리뷰를 지원","Storybook预览 URL을 통합","CI 상태를 자동으로 확인","UI 리뷰를 지원","headed 브라우저 모드를 지원","코드 diff 기능을 제공"],"es":["Revisión de PRs en Razorpay/blade con GitH","Verificación del estado de CI","Extracción de la URL de Storybook","Compatibilidad con ShouldReviewUI y ShouldRunHeadedBrowser","Integración con la herramienta AskQuestion de Cursor"],"fr":["Examen des PRs dans Razorpay/blade avec GitH","Vérification du statut de CI","Extraction de l''URL de Storybook","Compatibilité avec ShouldReviewUI et ShouldRunHeadedBrowser","Intégration avec l''outil AskQuestion de Cursor"],"de":["Überprüfung von PRs in Razorpay/blade mit GitH","Überprüfung des CI-Status","Extraktion der Storybook-URL","Kompatibilität mit ShouldReviewUI und ShouldRunHeadedBrowser","Integration mit der AskQuestion-Tool von Cursor"],"pt":["Verificação de alterações no repositório Razorpay/blade","Verificação do status do CI","Extração da URL de visualização do Storybook","Suporte a revisão de UI","Suporte a execução de navegador em modo headed"],"ru":["Проверка изменений в репозитории Razorpay/blade","Проверка статуса CI","Извлечение URL-адреса предпросмотра Storybook","Поддержка проверки UI","Поддержка запуска браузера в режиме headed"],"ar":["مراجعة التغييرات في مستودع Razorpay/blade","مراجعة حالة CI","استخراج رابط معاينة Storybook","دعم مراجعة UI","دعم تشغيل المتصفح في وضع headed"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use review-changes","review-changes setup guide","review-changes alternative","review-changes vs GitHub code review","review-changes install","what is review-changes","review-changes for Razorpay","review-changes and Storybook","review-changes CI status check","review-changes Git integration"],"zh":["Review Changes AIエージェント","Razorpay 设计系统","代码审查工具","Git 代码审查","Storybook 预览 URL","CI 状态检查","UI 审查","headed 浏览器模式","代码 diff"],"ja":["Review Changes AIエージェント","Razorpay デザインシステム","コードレビューツール","Git コードレビュー","Storybook プレビュー URL","CI 状態確認","UI レビュー","headed ブラウザモード","コード diff"],"ko":["리뷰 변경 사항 AI 에이전트","Razorpay 디자인 시스템","코드 리뷰 도구","Git 코드 리뷰","Storybook预览 URL","CI 상태 확인","UI 리뷰","headed 브라우저 모드","코드 diff"],"es":["review-changes","Razorpay","GitH","Storyboard","ShouldReviewUI","ShouldRunHeadedBrowser","agente de IA","herramientas de desarrollo","revisión de PRs"],"fr":["review-changes","Razorpay","GitH","Storyboard","ShouldReviewUI","ShouldRunHeadedBrowser","agent IA","outils de développement","examen de PRs"],"de":["review-changes","Razorpay","GitH","Storyboard","ShouldReviewUI","ShouldRunHeadedBrowser","IA-Agent","Entwicklungstools","Überprüfung von PRs"],"pt":["review-changes","Razorpay","revisão de código","ferramenta de revisão","automatização de fluxo de trabalho","GitH","Storybook","CI"],"ru":["ИИ Агент review-changes","Razorpay","проверка изменений","инструмент для проверки","автоматизация рабочего процесса","GitH","Storybook","CI"],"ar":["أداة مراجعة التغييرات review-changes","Razorpay","مراجعة التغييرات","أداة لمراجعة التغييرات","تحديث سير العمل","GitH","Storybook","CI"]}},"owner":"razorpay","repo":"blade","repoPath":"razorpay/blade","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.481Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"review-changes","description":"Review blade PRs by fetching diff, checking CI status, and getting Storybook URL. Use when reviewing PRs, checking PR status, or getting preview links for razorpay/blade PRs.","bodyPreview":"# Review Blade PR\n\nReview PRs in the razorpay/blade repository by fetching the diff, checking CI status, and extracting the Storybook preview URL.\n\n## Arguments / Clarifications (Use Cursor''s AskQuestion tool to get clarifications)\n\n- PR: Link / Number of the PR to review\n- ShouldReviewUI: Whether UI should be reviewed or not. Get it clarified if not mentioned.\n- ShouldRunHeadedBrowser: Whether to run the browser in headed mode or not. Get it clarified if not mentioned.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- GitH","body":"# Review Blade PR\n\nReview PRs in the razorpay/blade repository by fetching the diff, checking CI status, and extracting the Storybook preview URL.\n\n## Arguments / Clarifications (Use Cursor''s AskQuestion tool to get clarifications)\n\n- PR: Link / Number of the PR to review\n- ShouldReviewUI: Whether UI should be reviewed or not. Get it clarified if not mentioned.\n- ShouldRunHeadedBrowser: Whether to run the browser in headed mode or not. Get it clarified if not mentioned.\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n- GitHub CLI (`gh`) must be installed and authenticated\n- `agent-browser` command must be installed (if ShouldReviewUI is true)\n\n## Guidelines\n\n- Avoid printing intermediate commentary; only output the final review in the main chat\n\n## Steps (Create checklist for each step)\n\n### 1. Fetch the PR Diff and CI Status in Main Agent\n\n```\nhttps://patch-diff.githubusercontent.com/raw/razorpay/blade/pull/{PR_NUMBER}.diff\n```\n\n(Ignore the lock file changes from diff)\n\nFetch status checks once and extract both CI status and Storybook URL:\n\n```bash\ngh pr checks {PR_NUMBER} --repo razorpay/blade\n```\n\n#### If checks are failing / skipped, get the details from the checks on why they are failing / skipped\n\nUse the following command (replace `{JOB_ID}` with the job id from the previous `gh pr checks` output):\n\n```bash\ngh run view --job {JOB_ID} --repo razorpay/blade\n```\n\n### 2. UI Review the Changes (if ShouldReviewUI is true)\n\n- Using agent-browser (Do NOT use Playwright MCP), open the Storybook URL (returned by earlier subagent)\n  - `agent-browser --help` on docs on how to use it\n- Determine which URL to open based on the PR changes\n- `agent-browser close` to close any earlier opened browser instances\n- Open the URL with the agent-browser and test the functionality of the changes\n  ```sh\n  agent-browser open {storybook_url} --headed (if ShouldRunHeadedBrowser is true)\n  ```\n- Close the agent-browser at the end with `agent-browser close`\n\n#### How to Find Changes\n\n- You can open the story outside iframe using the `iframe.html` url of storybook\n  - E.g. `https://61c19ee8d3d282003ac1d81c-rzqbxanzgn.chromatic.com/?path=/story/components-datepicker--date-picker-presets-with-display-format-compact` this story can be opened as an iframe in `https://61c19ee8d3d282003ac1d81c-rzqbxanzgn.chromatic.com/iframe.html?args=&id=components-datepicker--date-picker-presets-with-display-format-compact&viewMode=story`\n  - If iframe is not working, open the storybook url directly and find the story in the sidebar\n- If changes are in svelte components, check the svelte version of storybook on `{storybook_base_url}/svelte/` route\n\nReport the flows / features that were tested, if they are working as expected or not, and the issues found.\n\n### 3. Code Review the Changes\n\nAnalyze the diff for:\n\n- Potential bugs or logic errors\n- TypeScript/type safety issues\n- Missing tests for new functionality\n- Accessibility concerns\n- Performance implications\n- API Breaking changes\n- Do not review the changes in the codebase, only review the changes in the diff.\n\n## Output Format\n\nThe subagent should return all the gathered information. Then in the main chat strictly following the output format mentioned in references/output-format.md\n\n- [Output Format](./references/output-format.md)\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:09:54.689Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for GitHub-integrated AI Agents like Cursor and AutoGPT needing streamlined PR review automation for repositories such as razorpay/blade.","zh":"适用于像Cursor和AutoGPT这样的GitHub集成AI代理，需要为诸如razorpay/blade的仓库简化PR审查自动化。","ja":"CursorやAutoGPTのようなGitHub統合AIエージェントに適しており、razorpay/bladeなどのリポジトリのPRレビューの自動化を簡素化する必要があります。","ko":"Cursor와 AutoGPT와 같은 GitHub 통합 AI 에이전트에 적합하며 razorpay/blade와 같은 저장소의 PR 리뷰 자동화를 간소화해야 합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA integrados con GitHub como Cursor y AutoGPT que necesitan una automatización de revisión de PR optimizada para repositorios como razorpay/blade.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA intégrés à GitHub comme Cursor et AutoGPT nécessitant une automation de révision de PR optimisée pour des référentiels tels que razorpay/blade.","de":"Ideal für GitHub-integrierte KI-Agents wie Cursor und AutoGPT, die eine optimierte PR-Überprüfung für Repositorys wie razorpay/blade benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para agentes de IA integrados ao GitHub, como Cursor e AutoGPT, que necessitam de automação de revisão de PRs simplificada para repositórios como razorpay/blade.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, интегрированных с GitHub, таких как Cursor и AutoGPT, которым требуется упрощенная автоматизация проверки PR для репозиториев, таких как razorpay/blade.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكاء الاصطناعي المتكاملين مع GitHub مثل Cursor و AutoGPT الذي يحتاج إلى توفير تلقائي لمراجعة PRs لمستودعات مثل razorpay/blade."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate diff fetching, perform CI status checks, and extract Storybook preview URLs, streamlining the review process for developers working with design systems using Git and Storybook.","zh":"赋予代理自动化diff获取、执行CI状态检查和提取Storybook预览URL的能力，从而为使用Git和Storybook的设计系统的开发人员简化审查流程。","ja":"エージェントがdiffの取得、CI状態の確認、StorybookプレビューURLの抽出を自動化する能力を付与し、GitとStorybookを使用したデザインシステムの開発者がレビューのプロセスを簡素化できるようにします。","ko":"에이전트가 diff를 가져오고 CI 상태를 확인하며 Storybook预览 URL을 추출하여 Git과 Storybook를 사용하는 디자인 시스템 개발자가 리뷰 프로세스를 간소화할 수 있도록 합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar la obtención de diferencias, realizar comprobaciones de estado de CI y extraer direcciones URL de vista previa de Storybook, optimizando el proceso de revisión para los desarrolladores que trabajan con sistemas de diseño usando Git y Storybook.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser la récupération de différences, d''effectuer des vérifications d''état de CI et d''extraire des adresses URL d''aperçu de Storybook, optimisant ainsi le processus de révision pour les développeurs travaillant avec des systèmes de conception utilisant Git et Storybook.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agents, die Übernahme von Differenzen zu automatisieren, CI-Status-Checks durchzuführen und Storybook-Vorschau-URLs zu extrahieren, wodurch der Überprüfungsprozess für Entwickler, die mit Design-Systemen unter Verwendung von Git und Storybook arbeiten, optimiert wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes automatem a captura de diffs, realizem verificações de status de CI e extraiam URLs de visualização do Storybook, simplificando o processo de revisão para desenvolvedores que trabalham com sistemas de design usando Git e Storybook.","ru":"Позволяет агентам автоматизировать получение diff, выполнять проверки статуса CI и извлекать URL-адреса предварительного просмотра Storybook, упрощая процесс проверки для разработчиков, работающих с системами дизайна, используя Git и Storybook.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء توفير AutomatingFetchingFetchingFetching من diffs وتنفيذ فحص حالة CI واستخراج URLs معاينة Storybook، وبذلك يُبسّط عملية المراجعة للمطورين الذين يعملون مع أنظمة التصميم باستخدام Git و Storybook."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating PR reviews for razorpay/blade repository","Fetching diffs for efficient code comparison","Extracting Storybook preview URLs for UI review"],"zh":["为razorpay/blade仓库自动化PR审查","获取diff以进行高效的代码比较","提取Storybook预览URL以进行UI审查"],"ja":["razorpay/bladeリポジトリのPRレビューの自動化","diffの取得による効率的なコード比較","StorybookプレビューURLの抽出によるUIレビュー"],"ko":["razorpay/blade 저장소의 PR 리뷰 자동화","diff를 가져와 효율적인 코드 비교를 수행","Storybook预览 URL을 추출하여 UI 리뷰를 수행"],"es":["Automatización de revisiones de PR para el repositorio razorpay/blade","Obtención de diferencias para una comparación de código eficiente","Extracción de direcciones URL de vista previa de Storybook para la revisión de la interfaz de usuario"],"fr":["Automation des révisions de PR pour le référentiel razorpay/blade","Récupération de différences pour une comparaison de code efficace","Extraction des adresses URL d''aperçu de Storybook pour la révision de l''interface utilisateur"],"de":["Automatisierung von PR-Überprüfungen für das Repository razorpay/blade","Abruf von Differenzen für einen effizienten Code-Vergleich","Extraktion von Storybook-Vorschau-URLs für die Überprüfung der Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Automatizar revisões de PRs para o repositório razorpay/blade","Buscar diffs para comparação de código eficiente","Extrair URLs de visualização do Storybook para revisão de UI"],"ru":["Автоматизировать проверку PR для репозитория razorpay/blade","Получать diff для эффективного сравнения кода","Извлекать URL-адреса предварительного просмотра Storybook для проверки UI"],"ar":["توفير تلقائي لمراجعة PRs لمستودع razorpay/blade","جلب الفروق لتحليل كود فعال","استخراج URLs معاينة Storybook لمراجعة واجهة المستخدم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub access","Specific to razorpay/blade repository or similar design system repositories","Needs clarification on ShouldReviewUI and ShouldRunHeadedBrowser arguments for optimal use"],"zh":["需要GitHub访问","具体到razorpay/blade仓库或类似的设计系统仓库","需要对ShouldReviewUI和ShouldRunHeadedBrowser参数进行阐明以实现最佳使用"],"ja":["GitHubへのアクセスが