orkflows","zh":"browser-use是一种用于浏览器自动化的命令行工具","ja":"browser-useはブラウザ自動化のためのコマンドラインツールです","ko":"browser-use는 브라우저 자동화를 위한 명령줄 도구입니다","es":"browser-use es una herramienta de automatización de navegador que utiliza comandos CLI para mantener sesiones de navegador","fr":"browser-use est un outil d''automatisation de navigateur qui utilise des commandes CLI pour maintenir les sessions de navigateur","de":"browser-use ist ein Browser-Automatisierungstool, das CLI-Befehle verwendet, um Browser-Sitzungen beizubehalten","pt":"O browser-use é uma ferramenta de automação de navegador que fornece uma forma personalizada de interagir com browsers","ru":"Browser-use - это инструмент для автоматизации браузера, который предоставляет персонализированный способ взаимодействия с браузерами с ИИ Агентами","ar":"browser-use هي أداة آليّة المتصفح التي توفر طريقة مخصصة لتفاعل مع المتصفحات باستخدام أدوات الإي أى"},"features":{"en":["Persistent browser sessions across commands via browser-use CLI","Fast browser automation with uvx browser-use[cli] command","Installation and setup via uv pip install browser-use[cli] and browser-use install","Support for Chromium browser dependencies","Adaptive learning and secure code execution through its intelligent multi-agent system","Gamification and social learning features for enhanced coding education"],"zh":["快速持久的浏览器自动化","支持复杂的多步骤工作流程","基于FastAPI、React、PostgreSQL和Docker的构建","安全的代码执行","Spec-driven开发"],"ja":["高速で永続的なブラウザ自動化","複雑なマルチステップのワークフローをサポート","FastAPI、React、PostgreSQL、Dockerを使用した構築","安全なコード実行","Spec-driven開発"],"ko":["빠르고 지속적인 브라우저 자동화","복잡한 멀티스텝 워크플로를 지원","FastAPI, React, PostgreSQL, Docker를 사용한 구축","안전한 코드 실행","Spec-driven 개발"],"es":["Automatización de navegador con comandos rápidos y persistentes","Mantiene sesiones de navegador a través de comandos","Permite flujos de trabajo complejos y multi-paso","Instalación y ejecución seguras con uvx y pip","Compatibilidad con Chromium para una amplia gama de funcionalidades"],"fr":["Automatisation du navigateur avec des commandes rapides et persistantes","Maintient les sessions de navigateur à travers les commandes","Permet des flux de travail complexes et multi-étapes","Installation et exécution sécurisées avec uvx et pip","Compatibilité avec Chromium pour une large gamme de fonctionnalités"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung mit schnellen und persistenten Befehlen","Beibehält Browser-Sitzungen über Befehle hinweg","Ermöglicht komplexe und mehrschrittige Arbeitsabläufe","Sichere Installation und Ausführung mit uvx und pip","Kompatibilität mit Chromium für eine breite Palette von Funktionen"],"pt":["Automação de navegador com CLI","Suporte a tecnologias como FastAPI e React","Instalação permanente ou uso sem instalação","Comandos para abrir URLs e instalar dependências","Suporte a sessões de navegador persistentes"],"ru":["Автоматизация браузера с CLI","Поддержка технологий как FastAPI и React","Установка постоянная или использование без установки","Команды для открытия URL и установки зависимостей","Поддержка постоянных сессий браузера с ИИ Агентами"],"ar":["آليّة المتصفح مع واجهة سطر الأوامر","دعم تقنيات مثل FastAPI و React","تثبيت دائم أو استخدام بدون تثبيت","أوامر لفتح URLs وتثبيت التبعيات","دعم جلسات المتصفح المستمرة مع أدوات الإي أى"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use browser-use","browser-use setup guide","browser-use alternative","browser-use vs selenium","browser-use install","browser automation with browser-use","what is browser-use","browser-use CLI commands","browser-use for developers"],"zh":["浏览器自动化","AIエージェント","个性化编码教育","FastAPI","React","PostgreSQL","Docker","Spec-driven开发"],"ja":["ブラウザ自動化","AIエージェント","個別化コード教育","FastAPI","React","PostgreSQL","Docker","Spec-driven開発"],"ko":["브라우저 자동화","AI 에이전트","개인화된 코딩 교육","FastAPI","React","PostgreSQL","Docker","Spec-driven 개발"],"es":["automatización de navegador","browser-use","CLI","uvx","pip","Chromium","flujos de trabajo complejos","seguridad en la instalación","herramientas de automatización de navegador"],"fr":["automatisation du navigateur","browser-use","CLI","uvx","pip","Chromium","flux de travail complexes","sécurité d''installation","outils d''automatisation de navigateur"],"de":["Browser-Automatisierung","browser-use","CLI","uvx","pip","Chromium","komplexe Arbeitsabläufe","Sicherheit bei der Installation","Browser-Automatisierungstools"],"pt":["browser-use","automação de navegador","CLI","FastAPI","React","produtividade","ferramentas de desenvolvimento","desenvolvimento web"],"ru":["browser-use","автоматизация браузера","CLI","FastAPI","React","производительность","инструменты для разработки","веб-разработка","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["browser-use","آليّة المتصفح","واجهة سطر الأوامر","FastAPI","React","الإنتاجية","أدوات التطوير","تطوير الويب","أدوات الإي أى"]}},"owner":"khushparag","repo":"agentic_learning_coach","repoPath":"khushparag/agentic_learning_coach","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.542Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"browser-use","description":"Automates browser interactions for web testing, form filling, screenshots, and data extraction. Use when the user needs to navigate websites, interact with web pages, fill forms, take screenshots, or extract information from web pages.","bodyPreview":"# Browser Automation with browser-use CLI\n\nThe `browser-use` command provides fast, persistent browser automation. It maintains browser sessions across commands, enabling complex multi-step workflows.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Run without installing (recommended for one-off use)\nuvx browser-use[cli] open https://example.com\n\n# Or install permanently\nuv pip install browser-use[cli]\n\n# Install browser dependencies (Chromium)\nbrowser-use install\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nbrowser-use open https","body":"# Browser Automation with browser-use CLI\n\nThe `browser-use` command provides fast, persistent browser automation. It maintains browser sessions across commands, enabling complex multi-step workflows.\n\n## Installation\n\n```bash\n# Run without installing (recommended for one-off use)\nuvx browser-use[cli] open https://example.com\n\n# Or install permanently\nuv pip install browser-use[cli]\n\n# Install browser dependencies (Chromium)\nbrowser-use install\n```\n\n## Quick Start\n\n```bash\nbrowser-use open https://example.com           # Navigate to URL\nbrowser-use state                              # Get page elements with indices\nbrowser-use click 5                            # Click element by index\nbrowser-use type \"Hello World\"                 # Type text\nbrowser-use screenshot                         # Take screenshot\nbrowser-use close                              # Close browser\n```\n\n## Core Workflow\n\n1. **Navigate**: `browser-use open <url>` - Opens URL (starts browser if needed)\n2. **Inspect**: `browser-use state` - Returns clickable elements with indices\n3. **Interact**: Use indices from state to interact (`browser-use click 5`, `browser-use input 3 \"text\"`)\n4. **Verify**: `browser-use state` or `browser-use screenshot` to confirm actions\n5. **Repeat**: Browser stays open between commands\n\n## Browser Modes\n\n```bash\nbrowser-use --browser chromium open <url>      # Default: headless Chromium\nbrowser-use --browser chromium --headed open <url>  # Visible Chromium window\nbrowser-use --browser real open <url>          # User''s Chrome with login sessions\nbrowser-use --browser remote open <url>        # Cloud browser (requires API key)\n```\n\n- **chromium**: Fast, isolated, headless by default\n- **real**: Uses your Chrome with cookies, extensions, logged-in sessions\n- **remote**: Cloud-hosted browser with proxy support (requires BROWSER_USE_API_KEY)\n\n## Commands\n\n### Navigation\n```bash\nbrowser-use open <url>                    # Navigate to URL\nbrowser-use back                          # Go back in history\nbrowser-use scroll down                   # Scroll down\nbrowser-use scroll up                     # Scroll up\n```\n\n### Page State\n```bash\nbrowser-use state                         # Get URL, title, and clickable elements\nbrowser-use screenshot                    # Take screenshot (outputs base64)\nbrowser-use screenshot path.png           # Save screenshot to file\nbrowser-use screenshot --full path.png    # Full page screenshot\n```\n\n### Interactions (use indices from `browser-use state`)\n```bash\nbrowser-use click <index>                 # Click element\nbrowser-use type \"text\"                   # Type text into focused element\nbrowser-use input <index> \"text\"          # Click element, then type text\nbrowser-use keys \"Enter\"                  # Send keyboard keys\nbrowser-use keys \"Control+a\"              # Send key combination\nbrowser-use select <index> \"option\"       # Select dropdown option\n```\n\n### Tab Management\n```bash\nbrowser-use switch <tab>                  # Switch to tab by index\nbrowser-use close-tab                     # Close current tab\nbrowser-use close-tab <tab>               # Close specific tab\n```\n\n### JavaScript & Data\n```bash\nbrowser-use eval \"document.title\"         # Execute JavaScript, return result\nbrowser-use extract \"all product prices\"  # Extract data using LLM (requires API key)\n```\n\n### Python Execution (Persistent Session)\n```bash\nbrowser-use python \"x = 42\"               # Set variable\nbrowser-use python \"print(x)\"             # Access variable (outputs: 42)\nbrowser-use python \"print(browser.url)\"   # Access browser object\nbrowser-use python --vars                 # Show defined variables\nbrowser-use python --reset                # Clear Python namespace\nbrowser-use python --file script.py       # Execute Python file\n```\n\nThe Python session maintains state across commands. The `browser` object provides:\n- `browser.url` - Current page URL\n- `browser.title` - Page title\n- `browser.goto(url)` - Navigate\n- `browser.click(index)` - Click element\n- `browser.type(text)` - Type text\n- `browser.screenshot(path)` - Take screenshot\n- `browser.scroll()` - Scroll page\n- `browser.html` - Get page HTML\n\n### Agent Tasks (Requires API Key)\n```bash\nbrowser-use run \"Fill the contact form with test data\"    # Run AI agent\nbrowser-use run \"Extract all product prices\" --max-steps 50\n```\n\nAgent tasks use an LLM to autonomously complete complex browser tasks. Requires `BROWSER_USE_API_KEY` or configured LLM API key (OPENAI_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY, etc).\n\n### Session Management\n```bash\nbrowser-use sessions                      # List active sessions\nbrowser-use close                         # Close current session\nbrowser-use close --all                   # Close all sessions\n```\n\n### Server Control\n```bash\nbrowser-use server status                 # Check if server is running\nbrowser-use server stop                   # Stop server\nbrowser-use server logs                   # View server logs\n```\n\n### Setup\n```bash\nbrowser-use install                       # Install Chromium and system dependencies\n```\n\n## Global Options\n\n| Option | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `--session NAME` | Use named session (default: \"default\") |\n| `--browser MODE` | Browser mode: chromium, real, remote |\n| `--headed` | Show browser window (chromium mode) |\n| `--profile NAME` | Chrome profile (real mode only) |\n| `--json` | Output as JSON |\n| `--api-key KEY` | Override API key |\n\n**Session behavior**: All commands without `--session` use the same \"default\" session. The browser stays open and is reused across commands. Use `--session NAME` to run multiple browsers in parallel.\n\n## API Key Configuration\n\nSome features (`run`, `extract`, `--browser remote`) require an API key. The CLI checks these locations in order:\n\n1. `--api-key` command line flag\n2. `BROWSER_USE_API_KEY` environment variable\n3. `~/.config/browser-use/config.json` file\n\nTo configure permanently:\n```bash\nmkdir -p ~/.config/browser-use\necho ''{\"api_key\": \"your-key-here\"}'' > ~/.config/browser-use/config.json\n```\n\n## Examples\n\n### Form Submission\n```bash\nbrowser-use open https://example.com/contact\nbrowser-use state\n# Shows: [0] input \"Name\", [1] input \"Email\", [2] textarea \"Message\", [3] button \"Submit\"\nbrowser-use input 0 \"John Doe\"\nbrowser-use input 1 \"john@example.com\"\nbrowser-use input 2 \"Hello, this is a test message.\"\nbrowser-use click 3\nbrowser-use state  # Verify success\n```\n\n### Multi-Session Workflows\n```bash\nbrowser-use --session work open https://work.example.com\nbrowser-use --session personal open https://personal.example.com\nbrowser-use --session work state    # Check work session\nbrowser-use --session personal state  # Check personal session\nbrowser-use close --all             # Close both sessions\n```\n\n### Data Extraction with Python\n```bash\nbrowser-use open https://example.com/products\nbrowser-use python \"\nproducts = []\nfor i in range(20):\n    browser.scroll(''down'')\nbrowser.screenshot(''products.png'')\n\"\nbrowser-use python \"print(f''Captured {len(products)} products'')\"\n```\n\n### Using Real Browser (Logged-In Sessions)\n```bash\nbrowser-use --browser real open https://gmail.com\n# Uses your actual Chrome with existing login sessions\nbrowser-use state  # Already logged in!\n```\n\n## Tips\n\n1. **Always run `browser-use state` first** to see available elements and their indices\n2. **Use `--headed` for debugging** to see what the browser is doing\n3. **Sessions persist** - the browser stays open between commands\n4. **Use `--json` for parsing** output programmatically\n5. **Python variables persist** across `browser-use python` commands within a session\n6. **Real browser mode** preserves your login sessions and extensions\n7. **CLI aliases**: `bu`, `browser`, and `browseruse` all work identically to `browser-use`\n\n## Troubleshooting\n\n**Browser won''t start?**\n```bash\nbrowser-use install                   # Install/reinstall Chromium\nbrowser-use server stop               # Stop any stuck server\nbrowser-use --headed open <url>       # Try with visible window\n```\n\n**Element not found?**\n```bash\nbrowser-use state                     # Check current elements\nbrowser-use scroll down               # Element might be below fold\nbrowser-use state                     # Check again\n```\n\n**Session issues?**\n```bash\nbrowser-use sessions                  # Check active sessions\nbrowser-use close --all               # Clean slate\nbrowser-use open <url>                # Fresh start\n```\n\n## Cleanup\n\n**Always close the browser when done.** Run this after completing browser automation:\n\n```bash\nbrowser-use close\n```\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:11:13.605Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Automation Agents needing persistent browser sessions and multi-step workflow automation.","zh":"非常适合需要持久浏览器会话和多步骤工作流自动化的自动化代理。","ja":"永続的なブラウザセッションとマルチステップのワークフローオートメーションが必要な自動化エージェントに最適です。","ko":"영구 브라우저 세션과 多단계 워크플로 자동화가 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Automatización que necesitan sesiones de navegador persistentes y automatización de flujos de trabajo de varios pasos.","fr":"Parfait pour les Agents d''Automation nécessitant des sessions de navigateur persistantes et une automatisation de workflow à plusieurs étapes.","de":"Perfekt für Automatisierungsagenten, die persistente Browser-Sitzungen und eine Automatisierung von Workflows mit mehreren Schritten benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Automação que necessitam de sessões de navegador persistentes e automação de fluxos de trabalho em várias etapas.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов автоматизации, которым требуются постоянные сеансы браузера и автоматизация рабочих процессов из нескольких шагов.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الآليين الذين يحتاجون إلى جلسات متصفح مستمرة وتوفر автомatisation تدفق العمل المتعددة المراحل."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate browser interactions using FastAPI and React, with persistent sessions maintained across commands, enabling complex workflows and leveraging PostgreSQL for data storage.","zh":"通过使用FastAPI和React使代理能够自动化浏览器交互，命令间保持持久会话，实现复杂的工作流，并利用PostgreSQL进行数据存储。","ja":"FastAPIとReactを使用して、エージェントがブラウザとのやり取りを自動化できるようにし、コマンド間で持続的なセッションを維持し、複雑なワークフローを可能にし、PostgreSQLを使用してデータを保存します。","ko":"FastAPI와 React를 사용하여 에이전트가 브라우저 상호 작용을 자동화 할 수 있도록 하여 명령어 사이에서 지속적인 세션을 유지하고 복잡한 워크플로를 가능하게 하며 PostgreSQL을 사용하여 데이터를 저장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar las interacciones del navegador utilizando FastAPI y React, con sesiones persistentes mantenidas en todos los comandos, lo que permite flujos de trabajo complejos y aprovecha PostgreSQL para el almacenamiento de datos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser les interactions de navigateur en utilisant FastAPI et React, avec des sessions persistantes maintenues à travers les commandes, permettant ainsi des workflows complexes et exploitant PostgreSQL pour le stockage de données.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, Browser-Interaktionen mit FastAPI und React zu automatisieren, wobei persistente Sitzungen über alle Befehle hinweg aufrechterhalten werden, was komplexe Workflows ermöglicht und PostgreSQL für die Datenspeicherung nutzt.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar interações do navegador usando FastAPI e React, com sessões persistentes mantidas em todo o comando, permitindo fluxos de trabalho complexos e aproveitando PostgreSQL para armazenamento de dados.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать взаимодействия с браузером с помощью FastAPI и React, с постоянными сессиями, поддерживаемыми на протяжении всех команд, что позволяет выполнять сложные рабочие процессы и использовать PostgreSQL для хранения данных.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على автомatisation التفاعلات المتصفح باستخدام FastAPI و React، مع الحفاظ على الجلسات المستمرة عبر الأوامر، مما يتيح سير عمل معقدة واستخدام PostgreSQL لتخزين البيانات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating browser-based data scraping","Performing multi-step browser workflows","Debugging browser automation scripts"],"zh":["自动化基于浏览器的数据抓取","执行多步骤浏览器工作流","调试浏览器自动化脚本"],"ja":["ブラウザベースのデータスクラピングの自動化","マルチステップブラウザワークフローの実行","ブラウザ自動化スクリプトのデバッグ"],"ko":["브라우저 기반 데이터 스크래핑 자동화","다중 브라우저 워크플로우 수행","브라우저 자동화 스크립트 디버깅"],"es":["Automatización de extracción de datos basada en el navegador","Ejecución de flujos de trabajo de navegador de varios pasos","Depuración de scripts de automatización de navegador"],"fr":["Automatisation de l''extraction de données basée sur le navigateur","Exécution de flux de travail de navigateur à plusieurs étapes","Débogage des scripts d''automatisation de navigateur"],"de":["Automatisierung von browserbasiertem Daten-Scraping","Ausführung von browserbasierten Workflows mit mehreren Schritten","Fehlerbehebung bei Browser-Automatisierungsskripten"],"pt":["Automatizar raspagem de dados baseada em navegador","Realizar fluxos de trabalho de navegador em várias etapas","Depurar scripts de automação de navegador"],"ru":["Автоматизировать извлечение данных на основе браузера","Выполнять многоступенчатые рабочие процессы браузера","Отлаживать скрипты автоматизации браузера"],"ar":["أتمتة استخراج البيانات المعتمدة على المتصفح","إجراء سير عمل متصفح متعددة المراحل","تصحيح أخطاء برامج أتمتة المتصفح"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Chromium browser installation","Dependent on uvx and pip for installation"],"zh":["需要安装Chromium浏览器","依赖于uvx和pip进行安装"],"ja":["Chromiumブラウザのインストールが必要","uvxとpipに依存してインストール"],"ko":["Chromium 브라우저 설치가 필요","uvx 및 pip에 의존하여 설치"],"es":["Requiere la instalación del navegador Chromium","Depende de uvx y pip para la instalación"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation du navigateur Chromium","Dépend de uvx et pip pour l''installation"],"de":["Benötigt die Installation des Chromium-Browsers","Ist von uvx und pip für die Installation abhängig"],"pt":["Requer instalação do navegador Chromium","Dependente de uvx e pip para instalação"],"ru":["Требует установки браузера Chromium","Зависит от uvx и pip для установки"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت متصفح Chromium","يعتمد على uvx و pip للتثبيت"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"44c7977eaa481427ddbeb7f84d72e36b06d457901cb195f4d9d90a8846bae5a8","qualityScore":60}');
